    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the parks, recreation and historic preservation law, in relation to renaming Riverbank state park; to authorize the renaming of the National Purple Heart Hall of Honor; to authorize the renaming of, in whole or in part, the New Windsor Cantonment state historic site; to amend the highway law, in relation to designating certain portions of the state highway system as the \"Senator William J. Larkin, Jr. Highway\"; and to amend the public authorities law, environmental conservation law and the highway law, in relation to naming the Governor Mario M. Cuomo Bridge",
    "basePrintNo": "S6827",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6827-2017",
    "coSponsors": {
